nowrap.description:
Keep the text on one line instead of wrapping. Overflow is left visible —
use `truncate` to clip it with an ellipsis.
@default false

truncate.description:
Keep the text on one line and clip the overflow with an ellipsis.
Implies `nowrap`.
@default false

